  Dialogue:
  - Time: 0
    Dialogue:
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][patterns="0"][auto]Welcome to Prefora! Here we''ll be
        teaching you the basics...'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0386d24fb27d77b408f0a2964a31b9b1, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][auto]In this game, you''ll follow the prompts of your
        opponent to defeat them by matching the rhythm!'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7912ca3e8300ec94092e7f25804d9bd2, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"]Gloria will perform a sequence of moves, and then you''ll
        try to repeat it back to dodge her attacks.  '
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f94faa5176bf4a4ab95a46b963a1922, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"]First, let''s start with just one note. When Gloria moves
        on the beat, you move on the next beat. For now she''ll just go UP.'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[tutorial="Hit(5)"][patterns="1"]Give it a try!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][patterns="0"][auto]Great job!!!'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 16b3134ad0a2cdc4fb97eb97e85ccd8e, type: 3}
    - Text: '[tutorial="Hit(5)"][patterns="1,2,3,4"]Now let''s try it with different
        directions. '
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 67591c10dc15ab346b7e9f37cfc86fb1, type: 3}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][patterns="0"][auto]Now you''re getting it!'
      Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 829ba8e9773e7a54cb485e6e345d6b78, type: 3}
    - Text: '[tutorial="Sequence(3)"][patterns="5,6"]Let''''s get all four directions
        in... Can you get the whole patterns? '
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][patterns="0"][auto]Fantastic!! When you do a whole pattern
        successfully, the enemy will lose health. If you miss a note, you''ll fail
        that sequence and lose health.'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[tutorial="Sequence(3)"][patterns="7,8,9"]Try and beat a few harder
        sequences here to prove you''ve got what it takes!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="tutorial"][patterns="0"][auto]Great work! Looks like you''re ready
        to take on the real thing. Good luck!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[tutorial="End(1)"]'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
